oader":{"login":"muthumanikandanb2005-ux","id":226152175,"node_id":"U_kgDODXrO7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226152175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","html_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":673,"digest":"sha256:6e8bd3a94346ed7867daa72897990a0f1230a113cc8829917e77b81046320a70","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-21T09:26:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:26:57Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/download/v3.1.9/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/tarball/v3.1.9","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.1.9","body":"## Pulse Music v3.1.9 (OTA Update for Android & Windows)\n\n### 🎈 Mini Capsule & Dynamic Island Features\n- 🎵 **Mini Live Equalizer Waveform**: Slender animated tri-bar spectrum that rhythmically reacts to music playback directly inside the mini capsule.\n- 🎤 **Synchronized Karaoke Lyrics Ticker**: Real-time line-by-line lyric tracker right on the capsule. Tap the artist name to switch seamlessly between artist info and live lyrics!\n- 🏷️ **Audio Quality Badge**: Crystal-clear codec indicators (Lossless, OPUS, AAC, HQ) rendered directly beside the track metadata.\n- 🏝️ **Expandable Floating Dynamic Island Overlay**: Long-press on the Mini Capsule to expand into an immersive liquid-glass dynamic player with album art, smooth seek scrubber with timestamps, full transport controls (Shuffle, Previous, Play/Pause, Next, Like), and quick volume adjustment!\n\n### 🚀 Update Engine & CDN Prioritization\n- CDN Prioritization (cdn.jsdelivr.net & raw GitHub) completely eliminates GitHub API 60-req/hr rate limiting (403 errors on shared mobile carrier CGNAT IPs).\n- 64-bit ID & Asset Deserialization: Full support for GitHub 64-bit integer IDs and multi-gigabyte asset sizes, permanently eliminating 'Server Error 200' crashes.\n- Resilient Content-Type handling for raw text/plain payloads, eliminating NoTransformationFoundException.\n- Friendly error notifications: Clear, graceful UI alerts replacing cryptic raw HTTP status codes.\n\n### 🎵 Enhanced Lyrics Accuracy & Quality\n- Strict title & artist normalization prevents irrelevant song lyrics from being matched.\n- Empty lyrics filtering: Completely eliminates blank or placeholder lyrics cards from playback screens.\n\n### 🌐 Listen Together Latency & Reconnection\n- Fixed coroutine cleanup race condition preventing secondary room connections.\n- Purged stale room tokens on leave/disconnect to ensure immediate room rejoin.\n- Reduced handshake and socket timeouts for faster session initialization.\n\n### ⚡ General Performance & Stability\n- Polished stability across Android & Windows platforms."}